optimization equations, 
cost of the optimzation 

J(t) = aC(t) + bL(t) + cE(t) 

C(t) computer usage 
L(t) latency 
E(t) error 

the goal is to min J(t)
to do maybe use gradient descent 

update rule for minimised cost in runtime 

x(t+1) = x(t) - eta Delta J(t)

eta is the learning rate 
small eta is stable 
large eta is risky but fast 

